	(text "VSET2=300k -> BUCK2 3.3V at startup (main rail).\nVSET1=GND -> BUCK1 OFF at startup; fw sets 3.3V,\n   enables only to mount SD (power gate).\nLDSW1 = LDO 1.8V from +3V3 -> BMM350 VDD.\nLDSW2 = load switch +3V3 -> +3V3_GPS.\n   Both OFF at boot - fw enables via I2C (0x6B).\nCharge current set in fw; NTC fixed 10k (no pack\n   thermistor) -> disable NTC monitor or treat 25C.\nLED0 = charger error, LED1 = charging (hw default).\nSHPHLD: power button, 10s hold = power cycle.\nVBUS_MCU: protected VBUS pass-through -> nRF54 K7."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 224 32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5fe5c2bc-5f19-4dc9-9380-ffa3694e1679")
	)
